narrative summary."}]}, {"id": "69662a3d-5b01-45ac-865a-1d1c46ccc135", "type": "topic", "title": "Origins of Cities, States, Writing, and Urban Society", "description": "This unit examines the emergence of complex societies and the tools that made states, law, administration, and social hierarchy possible. Students connect agriculture, urbanization, bureaucracy, writing, and power.", "children": [{"id": "7cd009a7-8ac5-4437-9b21-5fbce368e108", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Agriculture and settlement", "children": [{"id": "1b9ba4eb-d15a-4235-8b08-89683565bc2a", "type": "concept", "title": "domestication"}, {"id": "01756a2f-be60-4f81-a6e2-6e86dd23e407", "type": "concept", "title": "surplus"}, {"id": "485709a1-b7cd-407d-9f10-52fe9a1028eb", "type": "concept", "title": "irrigation"}, {"id": "9d20e8e5-5f51-4aa3-ad2a-4e4385c6504b", "type": "concept", "title": "sedentism"}, {"id": "8f728add-75cb-4658-a860-7fd760095ab5", "type": "concept", "title": "village life"}, {"id": "189ab4b2-df2d-47e8-ab8d-77e9dafada6f", "type": "concept", "title": "labor specialization"}, {"id": "cdef44fe-81a8-4070-93a0-d1c514d015fc", "type": "concept", "title": "population growth"}, {"id": "911b05c8-ef22-4b18-b944-cb5937f84601", "type": "concept", "title": "environmental stress"}], "description": "Students study how food production reshaped demography, labor, environment, and social organization."}, {"id": "6c02a704-5bc1-42ec-adc5-7ecf89638c65", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cities and institutions", "children": [{"id": "0bbd4cf9-af21-4bc1-a55d-9ca8df03129c", "type": "concept", "title": "urbanism"}, {"id": "578aebeb-2bd3-4d7f-8e41-74fb35f87580", "type": "concept", "title": "temple economy"}, {"id": "581a633f-ee2c-4aa1-bb33-e8589b20c352", "type": "concept", "title": "palace economy"}, {"id": "21467161-8267-427c-8b63-7da48dce7d62", "type": "concept", "title": "bureaucracy"}, {"id": "9cbfbdd5-7112-467b-b797-eddd67c5ae48", "type": "concept", "title": "taxation"}, {"id": "78e65af6-1b27-4a91-a5ce-22b2ab867